'''Shouchikubai Shiratori''' (白鳥 松竹梅 ''Shiratori Shōchikubai'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shouchikubai Shiratori
|image = E 145.png
|appearance = [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 460円 - 1,817円
}}

==Enemy==
Similar to [[Hoshi Grandmarnier (Enemy)|Hoshi Grandmarnier]], Shouchikubai Shiratori has low health and attack power, overall being not much of a big threat.

==Strategy==
Using any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] against this enemy will make quick work of him.

